brief:
  - "The products are simple: one face wash, one moisturiser, and a gift set with both. The hard part is that the men they're made for rarely go looking. The people who do buy are usually shopping for him, often for a birthday, Father's Day or Christmas."
  - "So the store had to make gifting easy, keep the routine short enough that he'll actually use it, and be set up to be found on Google from day one."
